    {
      "id": "L01_H024",
      "speaker": "instructor",
      "text": "Well done. Today, you learned how to greet someone, ask how they are, answer naturally, and keep the conversation going. Don't worry if you couldn't remember every expression. Your job is to recall a little more each time. In the next lesson, we'll build on these greetings and learn how to introduce ourselves and ask about names and where people are from. Listen again later and try the speaking exercises without looking at the transcript. See you in the next lesson.",
      "start": 985.122,
      "end": 1018.522,
      "pause_end": 1019.572
    }
  ]
